   - `@/hooks/useAuth` legacy path re-exports from `@/shared/hooks/useAuth`
   - `vi.useFakeTimers()` to prevent real timer scheduling blocking test completion
   - React 18 async `act()` waiting indefinitely for pending async effects (key issue)
   - Dynamic `await import()` inside test bodies - lazy module compilation
   - Vitest `transform`/`import`/`tests` phase breakdown
   - Module compile time: 4683-line files take 30+ seconds on this machine

